  message: "INV-nilud closed pending one BROAD bakeoff cycle. Campaign complete: PR-1 (WI-gifar, #3902), PR-2 (WI-hatip, #3904), PR-3 (WI-dukog, #3905), PR-4 (WI-sivuk, #3906), PR-5 (WI-puvil, #3908 / f447952fc9). Java analyzer's three inherited-call walks (Site 1: bare/this, Site 2: typed receiver, Site 3: inherited field) all lifted into the Tier-2 inherited_calls linker at priority 18. Single source of truth: linker module + per-class meta['fields'] populated by the Java analyzer. Ruby's _find_inherited_initialize and include/extend mixin coverage subsumed by the same substrate (PR-2 closed WI-puluf). 5-of-5 PRs tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation at merge. META transitions to satisfied after a full BROAD cycle confirms no regression — specifically: ast_call_inherited / ast_call_inherited_method / ast_call_inherited_field counts within stated tolerances on spring-petclinic, spring-boot, chatwoot, hypergumbo-self."  # e52b
